  "priorExpiration": "2009-11-11",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5008.01 Storage Requirements.\n\n(a) Display fireworks shall be kept in magazines which meet the requirements of these rules.\n\n(b) An outdoor magazine used for unattended overnight storage of display fireworks shall not be less than one cubic yard in size.\n\n(c) Display fireworks shall be stored in a type 4 magazine in compliance with the rules set forth in Saf-C 5009, or in types 1, 2 or 3 as set forth in Saf-C 1610, Saf-C 1611 and Saf-C 1612.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95; ss by #7481, eff 4-25-01, EXPIRED: 4-25-09\n\nNew. #9471, INTERIM, eff 5-15-09, EXPIRED: 11-11-09\n\nNew. #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5000.html"
